@startuml
title Todo: main path
hide empty description
top to bottom direction

state "Human edits design" as Design
state "Design review" as DesignReview
state "Implementation" as Implementation
state "Code review" as CodeReview

[*] --> Design
Design --> DesignReview : Review changes
DesignReview --> Implementation : Human accepts design
Design --> Implementation : Empty diff; human confirms
Implementation --> CodeReview
CodeReview --> [*] : Human accepts code
@enduml
